public_suffix_list.dat is a verbatim snapshot of the Mozilla Public Suffix List.

Source:  https://publicsuffix.org/list/public_suffix_list.dat
Project: https://github.com/publicsuffix/list

The Public Suffix List is licensed under the Mozilla Public License, v. 2.0:

    This Source Code Form is subject to the terms of the Mozilla Public
    License, v. 2.0. If a copy of the MPL was not distributed with this
    file, You can obtain one at https://mozilla.org/MPL/2.0/.

It is vendored here (rather than fetched at runtime) so password_audit.py can
compute registrable domains for de-duplication fully offline. Only the suffix
rules are read; see load_public_suffixes() in password_audit.py.
